%% (c) Apply plan — human approval gate → live twin → SUMO trucks reroute → audit
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor P as Planner
  participant UI as Web app
  participant C as Copilot
  participant A as API
  participant TW as Twin state
  participant S as Sim orchestrator
  participant M as SUMO runner (libsumo)
  participant PG as Postgres (plans, audit_log)

  opt Proposed by the Copilot
    C->>A: propose_apply(plan_id)
    A-->>UI: confirmation card (evidence links) — the LLM cannot apply
  end
  P->>UI: click "Apply Plan A"
  UI->>A: POST /plans/{id}/apply (JWT, role = planner)
  A->>A: RBAC check · plan still valid for current snapshot (version check)
  alt stale plan or forbidden
    A-->>UI: 409 / 403 — re-run scenario
  else ok
    A->>PG: BEGIN · UPDATE plans SET applied_at, applied_by · INSERT audit_log
    A->>TW: apply(actions): lane re-routes, transfers, safety-stock deltas
    TW->>S: schedule new shipments / route changes
    S->>M: close_road / spawn_truck / reroute_all (command queue)
    M->>M: traci.vehicle.rerouteTraveltime
    M-->>S: new FCD positions + arrival events
    S-->>TW: shipment ETAs updated
    A->>PG: COMMIT
    TW-->>A: live.diff (arcs re-routed, violet)
    A-->>UI: 200 {applied_at} + WS diff
    UI-->>P: toast + arcs re-route on map + trucks change roads in City Twin
    A->>PG: INSERT predictions (shadow mode) for fidelity scoring
  end
